        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Svetlana Zakharova\n- Events: Honolulu Marathon, Chicago Marathon, Boston Marathon\n- Places: Honolulu, Hawaii\n- Topics: marathon racing, sponsorship branding\n\nFacts:\n- Svetlana Zakharova won the Honolulu Marathon in 1997.\n- The Honolulu Marathon is a major 26.2-mile marathon held in Honolulu, Hawaii.\n- Svetlana Zakharova won the Honolulu Marathon again in 2002.\n- In 2003, Svetlana Zakharova won both the Chicago Marathon and the Boston Marathon.\n- Svetlana Zakharova won the Honolulu Marathon again in 2009.\n- The Honolulu Marathon is branded as the JAL Honolulu Marathon for sponsorship reasons.",
